<v Sarah Weschler>Yes.
<v Sarah Weschler>是的。

00:39:00.870 --> 00:39:10.900
<v Lawrence Weschler>Anyway, this sort of thing would go on all the time. And, at a later point, we began reading The Borrowers series, the series of wonderful books by Mary Noble.
