<v Lawrence Weschler>By Mary Norton, that's right. And, well, should Sarah describe what the book is about, maybe?
<v Lawrence Weschler>玛丽·诺顿，对，没错。嗯，莎拉或许应该描述一下这本书是关于什么的？

