00:39:20.680 --> 00:39:38.490
<v Sarah Weschler>Well, The Borrowers , it's about these little people who are, I think, like four inches tall. And they live under the floorboards in the house. And what they do is they take things from people, little things, that they can use around their house.
<v Sarah Weschler>嗯，《借东西的人》，它是关于这些小人的，我想，大约四英寸高。他们住在房子里的地板下面。他们做的是从人类那里拿走东西，小东西，他们可以在家里用的小东西。

00:39:38.490 --> 00:39:40.010
<v Lawrence Weschler>So what kinds of things do they take?
<v Lawrence Weschler>那么他们拿什么样的东西呢？

00:39:40.010 --> 00:39:49.860
<v Sarah Weschler>Well, they take pocket watches, and stamps, or pictures on the wall.
