00:39:49.860 --> 00:39:54.210
<v Lawrence Weschler>And part of the point about borrowers is that they're not allowed-- are they allowed to talk to people?
<v Lawrence Weschler>关于借东西的人，重点之一是他们不被允许——他们被允许和人类说话吗？

00:39:54.210 --> 00:39:54.560
<v Sarah Weschler>No.
<v Sarah Weschler>不。

