<v Sasha Meyerowitz>Yes. Yeah. Yeah. And I didn't imagine it. It was definitely there.
<v Sasha Meyerowitz>是的。是的。是的。我没有想象它。它绝对在那里。

00:41:31.600 --> 00:41:32.900
<v Ira Glass>And it was a little girl?
<v Ira Glass>而且是一个小女孩？

