<v Ira Glass>OK.
<v Ira Glass>好的。

00:41:35.490 --> 00:41:47.930
<v Lawrence Weschler>And then, over the next few days, Sarah began leaving things for this borrower. And the first thing in the morning she would race downstairs to see whether the things had been picked up.
<v Lawrence Weschler>然后，在接下来的几天里，莎拉开始为这个借东西的人留下东西。每天早上第一件事，她就会冲下楼去看看东西有没有被拿走。

