00:44:58.800 --> 00:45:12.550
<v Lawrence Weschler>Well, it was unclear. I mean, it was a possibility. And it was up to Sarah to keep dredging and find out more. And so a large part of the correspondences is Sarah doing genealogical work on the family and asking all kinds of questions.
